What if your next big career move wasn't buying another course...

...but building a 

**real GitHub project in 6 weeks** - 

**and winning all your money back when you succeed**?

Yes. Really.

This Cyber Monday, we're opening 

**early access** to the upcoming 

**SuperDataScience 6-Week
"Win Your Money Back" Challenge**, starting January 1st.

** Cyber Monday Early Access Price:**

**$200 today ($300 in January)**

→ Complete the challenge (scroll down for details)

**→ Get your $200 refunded**

